{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40786","headline":"邛州水亭夜讌送顾非熊之官 · 唐求","name":"邛州水亭夜讌送顾非熊之官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞邛城夜，寒塘对庾楼。\n蜀关蝉已噪，秦树叶应秋。\n道路连天远，笙歌到晓愁。\n不堪分袂後，残月正如鈎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}